; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Twisting Squares
; CATEGORY: Generative Art & Colour
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     squares, REPEAT, rotation, color gradient
; SUMMARY:  Draws a tunnel of squares, each a little smaller and a little more turned than the last.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   Starting with a big square, the turtle draws smaller and smaller
;   squares around the same middle point, turning each one a few
;   degrees. The corners trace out spiral arms, and the color fades
;   from blue on the outside to pink in the middle.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Change :twist or :shrink near the bottom.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * drawing a square around its middle instead of from a corner
;   * a variable that changes each time round a REPEAT
;   * blending colors with REPCOUNT
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Set :twist to 0. What do you see?
;   * Use triangles instead of squares.
;   * Make :shrink 0.98 and repeat 150 times.
; ============================================================

; SQUARE.AROUND draws a square of side :side centered on the turtle.
; The turtle walks out to a corner first, draws, and walks back to
; the middle, facing the way it started.
to square.around :side
  ; to the middle of the top edge, then left to the corner
  penup forward :side / 2 left 90 forward :side / 2
  ; turn round to face along the top edge, and draw
  left 180 pendown
  repeat 4 [forward :side right 90]
  ; back to the middle of the top edge, then down to the center
  penup forward :side / 2 right 90 forward :side / 2 right 180 pendown
end

; TUNNEL draws :count squares, each smaller and more turned.
to tunnel :count
  localmake "side 500
  repeat :count [
    localmake "t repcount / :count
    setpencolor (list 60 + 190 * :t 120 - 40 * :t 230 - 50 * :t)
    square.around :side
    right :twist
    make "side :side * :shrink
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [15 15 30]
setpensize 2
make "twist 4
make "shrink 0.95
tunnel 70
